{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "dce0974dbd80a7f0dc1215fab88e091049d76e2ab00e6e0e3a83bef33fc56abb", "ja": "『I.V.』VS新生『I.V.』", "zh": "『I.V.』VS新生『I.V.』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c4a4bf91738e3324cf264d396fcffd8f00264522b3a4fd30012e97ef224dea5", "ja": "織姫の望みは、オリジナル『I.V.』織姫と\n新生『I.V.』真珠星、藍、なる、クロエ\nの直接対決だった。フェスステージ当日。\n真珠星は織姫からもらったものを返し「自分\nの力、輝きでアイドルになる」と宣言する。", "zh": "织姬的愿望，是让原创《I.V.》织姬与\n新生《I.V.》真珠星、蓝、鸣、克洛伊展开直接对决。庆典舞台当天，\n真珠星归还了织姬给予自己的东西，并宣言：“我要凭自己的力量和光芒成为偶像。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "7921bc7f4345d6d583cc1d2f219ddb5be1fe5f2b5a8e527f8b89a214acd13281", "ja": "（お姉ちゃんが望んだのは、御梨音プロ主催の\nフェスでの、ふたつの『I.V.』の直接対決……）", "zh": "（姐姐所期望的，是在御梨音事务所主办的庆典上，让两个『I.V.』正面对决……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "9550122e9e81457f26f5db0c0e28cc171b80c3a5169859f4a73e3c39d7596aa3", "ja": "（オリジナル『I.V.』の織姫お姉ちゃんと、新生\n『I.V.』の私、藍さん、なるちゃん、クロエさん）", "zh": "（原创『I.V.』的织姬姐姐，以及新生『I.V.』的我、蓝小姐、娜露和克洛伊小姐）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "c21dcdd6e77ced9fdd7bb1079fe33600d22fe3096ee56d2dbea4fbd622f8e852", "ja": "（ふたつの『I.V.』が同時にパフォーマンスをし、\n観客の投票で結果を決める。それが『勝負』だった）", "zh": "（两个『I.V.』同时进行表演，由观众投票决定结果。这就是那场『对决』）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "c007fe8df249a0f4893cb42674ccca0db8423fd4b98367cfef1b938a714593c5", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、\nファイブ、シックス、セブン、エイト！", "zh": "一、二、三、四、\n五、六、七、八！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "fe35f8edd31d73caca0205037107f8666eb82c109db02dbd3b472de7b3161ce4", "ja": "ふう。さすがに久しぶりだから、\n体硬くなっちゃってるな～、アハハ！", "zh": "呼。毕竟隔了这么久，身体都变僵硬了呢～啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "3a4d94b1914cf09494d048517deaca646724610504fcdfed1e4df861b3754699", "ja": "そんなこと言って、私より全然動けてるし……\nていうか、本当に病気なの……？", "zh": "嘴上这么说，你明明比我灵活多了……\n话说回来，你真的生病了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "557070f03736f10344371f4ef3ac9260b42503cda374528d7e8014a9422b0bd1", "ja": "この短期間で、もう取り戻すとはね。センスだけは\n図抜けてるんだから……本当、ムカつく。", "zh": "才这么短的时间，你就已经恢复过来了。偏偏天赋出众得离谱……真是，气死我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "dfe7d7558569f9406dc36e80f6aa03f41d7e33feb22b887af956d019c4d533f4", "ja": "えへへ。本当はもう一回、藍ちゃんと一緒に\n『I.V.』やりたかったんだけどね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实我本来还想再和蓝一起演一次《I.V.》的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f2bb7942121aab13cf955e2728bed254b930b5d07e195e114a1b255991a27b1", "ja": "え？\nそうだったの？", "zh": "咦？\n原来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "67419b96e4e71acb91c24cc9057f567fa01d926c58e7e5f64a72e9297de4d732", "ja": "うん。でも、フラれちゃった！\nだからオリジナル『I.V.』は、私ひとりなんだ。", "zh": "嗯。不过，我被甩了！\n所以，原创《I.V.》就只有我一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "84d2f7f48abd2d73671d420334ac18e753f02fff0f2aee56fa88c047e6118496", "ja": "当然でしょ。現役の時も尻拭いさせられたのに、\nまたアンタの世話なんてお断りよ。", "zh": "理所当然吧。现役的时候就一直在给你收拾烂摊子，\n我才不要再去照顾你了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "8b888de9b04d8d74e8d10ee24d69c531765fe7c227eed3913a5d1ff1b42b6f35", "ja": "最後くらい、アンタを蹴り飛ばして\nやらないと気が済まないわ。", "zh": "最起码最后一次，不踹你一脚的话我心里过不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "2efc8a8228344eed80fda4316d2dd2c9707e3ef46818dd5d883666583b580deb", "ja": "えーっ！？\n藍ちゃんひどいよ～！", "zh": "诶——！？\n小蓝你也太过分了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "d9655f157bf314f11a9649ceda88dcfbfc9e11bc3afdb01a269ccdfc72b78f9b", "ja": "ひどくない。大体、真っ当にやってきたのに、\n炎上に巻き込まれる身にもなれっていうのよ。", "zh": "我哪里过分了。再说，明明一直都规规矩矩地做着，也该站在被卷进炎上的人的立场上想想啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "c9f25cb0bb56c9bbf26426d39cdeb60441430c84a07ebcaeb489e67890bfb426", "ja": "そういえば真珠星も炎上してたし……\nアンタたちってホント、似た者姉妹ね。", "zh": "说起来，真珠星也闹过炎上呢……  \n你们还真是对相像的姐妹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "364e190d31cdf8657e785d84730e2beff0eb1a98a0700bd33579bf10b99df6e5", "ja": "あ、あれは私は悪くないから！\n真田湊のせい！", "zh": "啊、那件事也不是我的错啊！\n都是真田湊的错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "8f950f7f5580b77ed298b7bf52f362f5fbb59763a828b0cd7576d566c212958d", "ja": "でも、『I.V.』対決ライブの反応は、\nそんなに悪い印象ばっかりじゃないみたいだよ？", "zh": "不过，大家对《I.V.》对决演唱会的反响，好像也不全是负面印象吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "d78b67782380f6a0b943d99e0815e75279fc8ed4882d6dd76ff0e7b1f04925a6", "ja": "私が事故を偽装した理由も、病気のことも、\nあっという間に調べられちゃったしね。", "zh": "我伪装事故的原因也好，病情的事也好，\n转眼间就被查出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "f860b30bc3d503c3583cce9b7f516fb6f0e8362c56dafc32ce9d9aa5d6fe2d8b", "ja": "ええ。……死期が近いということで、\n織姫に同情的な流れも生まれつつあるわ。", "zh": "是的。……因为据说她的死期将近，开始渐渐出现同情织姬的趋势了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "16b920113c054748c022af7e879e0b342747d46b71960f650c06ed9a79b89c10", "ja": "「このライブは、必ず伝説になる。\n見届けるべき」……。", "zh": "“这场演出必定会成为传说。\n我们理应去见证”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "807eb8818d2b4c24c3f48a8d105877b5bb6092e3ae65151b043801e62b4f9440", "ja": "もちろん反対意見もある。「死を売り物にした興行だ。\n到底許されるべきではない」……。", "zh": "当然也有反对意见。“拿死亡当作卖点的演出，\n绝不该被容许”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "5237eaf7dc0e27054a6dd17ec5163a71f1a7e0e46e3eed8c5a67c6d8c93b0087", "ja": "……ねえ。今さらだけど、\nどうして対決なんかしなきゃならないの？", "zh": "……那个。虽然事到如今才问，\n但为什么非得对决不可呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "84d1de8b2962ec9d4f4c72a3f34e9662e7b365a662e7095e7b43da73d5428c83", "ja": "？　だって、アイドルは夢を叶えるものでしょ？", "zh": "？因为，偶像不就是要实现梦想的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "7124d9a28fbbef2d2de5f93fc63531c0ea84b1b209c64fa3c466228bb7dd53d1", "ja": "それなら、私やみんなの夢を叶えてよ。\n真珠星はアイドルでしょ？", "zh": "那么，就请你实现我和大家的梦想吧。\n真珠星是偶像，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "038c3ed29bd378d84f48761419221791092669f170331d0e4b3f191e574948d8", "ja": "お姉ちゃんや……みんなの、夢……？", "zh": "姐姐和……大家的梦想……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "7564f4b2fab5df59f4ed33468d692e342872ad01639ddf2116e3944a357b0ad2", "ja": "うん！　真珠星は、アイドル好きだったもんね？\n小さすぎて覚えてないかもだけど。", "zh": "嗯！真珠星以前很喜欢偶像，对吧？\n虽然那时候还太小，可能已经不记得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc1d470c9d250c555b1919fda1af765a264cad913b03bab37b50ab5c298b2de2", "ja": "……ううん。ちゃんと、覚えてるよ。\n小さいころ、アイドルになりたかったこと……。", "zh": "……没有。我全都，好好记得哦。\n小时候，想成为偶像的心情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc19c0c9d2949f88bb6d5bab1b5c838857a17aa2ce24a0a153cb71e0e531789b", "ja": "私の、夢……。\nアイドルは……夢を、叶える……。", "zh": "我的梦想……偶像……会实现梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1028_null", "source_sha256": "850f1a488926001030b855ca220ccff12803c86b0186577282410276fef9eff1", "ja": "そして、御梨音フェス　本番当日……", "zh": "然后，御梨音祭典正式演出的当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "0904c24a1927b985c8d6466aa0111ab920ae0df337d9d656b600d01a4fa18851", "ja": "く、クロエさん。\n織姫さんのリハ、見ましたか……？", "zh": "克、克洛伊小姐。\n你看过织姬小姐的彩排了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "d2c536252be8cd75cfcfa3bf38fbb688a021b5a31c051578e7fb5b3fec73e68e", "ja": "見た。うまいな。", "zh": "看了。挺厉害的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "140c181f9d4dcc5d9593e2753cccef3e691ffd44567ae9d6508cb9c168ecddd0", "ja": "そ、それだけ……？\nその、とんでもないくらいのパワーで……！", "zh": "就、就这些……？\n那种强得离谱的力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "c36bba046e1fbade5a39436c2a494bbc4a3c7423bc2bc7c6319f8a7f848dd961", "ja": "まさか、あんなに圧倒的だなんて……。全てにおいて\nスキがなさすぎるし、どうやったら勝てるのか……。", "zh": "真没想到，竟然会那么有压倒性……不仅各个方面都\n毫无破绽，到底要怎样才能赢啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "dc7a86b433f6c58944b884944ece8a0f50338fe7250ef0b863f1f016025b7137", "ja": "別に……私たちはいつも通りやるだけだ。相手に\nスキがあるとかないとか、そういう次元じゃない。", "zh": "没什么……我们只要像平时一样发挥就行了。不是对手有没有破绽这种层面的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "2341b31f0b8319ef630e7d0193290bfbfa4d5a5e05450cf4f0ddfa6751adff5c", "ja": "踊った瞬間、ステージはあいつの世界になる。\n……あれは、そういうアイドルなんだろうな。", "zh": "她跳起来的瞬间，整个舞台就成了那家伙的世界。……那大概就是这样的偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "62b4f98352d7a7c65933b1f548888c9680f6fd2cf9256dcc8adcc3a2d433d8c9", "ja": "クロエさんにまで、そんなことを言わせるなんて……。\n私たち、とんでもない人を相手にしてるんじゃ……。", "zh": "竟然连克洛伊都说出这种话……。\n我们面对的该不会是个不得了的人吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "98d13990def163c92d80b470fadb30378be148f05625264416fd0d7a862ae0bd", "ja": "お疲れさま～！　……あれ、どしたの？　ふたりとも。\nそんなこわ～い顔してると、本来の力が出せないよ！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！……咦，怎么了？你们两个。一直摆着那么可怕的表情，可是发挥不出原本的实力哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "8785cdc303b2815f3ff5c95b31a0691c6a66be8a1a7f7f914b75835e783e41d8", "ja": "うるさいぞ、一宮織姫。\nというか、お前の楽屋はあっちだろ。", "zh": "吵死了，一宫织姬。  \n话说，你的休息室在那边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "b2189b5f35ab0a1eea9884b55f1e7ac57b24c6556d7c05f382bce4cf7b8e1474", "ja": "く、クロエさん……。すみません、織姫さん。\n……でも、お気遣いは不要です。", "zh": "呃、克洛伊小姐……对不起，织姬小姐。  \n……不过，您不用费心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "657cc788a099b861406a05e8d143f606a95e40dc265acbf1aa345f38cdbef58e", "ja": "私はともかく、クロエさんは\nあなたを倒す気満々ですから！", "zh": "先不说我，克洛伊可是干劲十足地想打倒你呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "86a6121d168656796a35b8fa878921672ad2e89aa8edb892bc6394387f5b4435", "ja": "よくわかってるじゃないか、三船。\n越えるハードルは高くないと意味がない。", "zh": "你不是很清楚嘛，三船。\n要跨越的栏杆不高的话，可就没有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "b481d25531030db9963844845679aedfdc5f3ad0bf8ed5bfdea9a1226395c48c", "ja": "そういうことみたいです。\n私は……死に物狂いでついていくだけです。", "zh": "看来是这样。\n我……只能拼命跟上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "29012bd334dcb8a0152ff5fcd06073737d49afca5ce5ea3eff70d6f1ad1346ac", "ja": "……ふふっ。ふたりとも、面白いね！\nさすが、藍ちゃんが選んだ子たちだなぁ。", "zh": "……呵呵。你们两个，真有意思呢！\n不愧是蓝选中的孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "67e107e81d9c8785d69ee1b1b98999a1bde9f40d8feabe0ef63d105a1b1306c9", "ja": "やー、新しい『I.V.』とライブできるなんて、\n長生きはするもんだなー。", "zh": "哎呀～能和全新的“I.V.”一起办演出，\n真是不枉我活了这么久啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "0f53aae3f22c3a0babcc5f6aae8b251579dac607855edbc7abf79adc911e41b8", "ja": "そういう、どこで笑えばいいのか\nわからないこと言うのやめて。", "zh": "别说这种让人不知道该笑哪里的奇怪话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "cd49a9a438f3634526d4d30e20a8a8a89f2a65abf561912865600548dec67666", "ja": "あっ、真珠星！　藍ちゃんも！", "zh": "啊，真珠星！小蓝也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "c03f8549475afbba47331328288028946c3ffa40f2ef61605bf4e7c7ffaaa757", "ja": "私も、お姉ちゃんに負ける気とかないから。\n……『I.V.』として。", "zh": "我也没有要输给姐姐的意思。……作为“I.V.”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "c02665c03c15bd019083c90a6ddd5efaa7b9eb9321fb2a2f6cc44c257d0c21e5", "ja": "それに、アイドル悪くないなって思ってるから。\nみんな自分の力で輝こうとしてて、すごいなって。", "zh": "而且，我觉得偶像也挺不错的。\n大家都在凭自己的力量闪耀，真的很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "44f0d4f20a8400f12eee3b9b2abfc595a584c3c1f7ecb4b2c75c5dc3cb30befd", "ja": "……ふうん？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1050_044miz", "source_sha256": "cd82860b7a43faf82ec92f9aefedad6e7e048b26c0be7ef549a9ca4839a66f31", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、言ってたよね？　今いる場所とか、\n大好きな人たち……全部を私にくれるって。", "zh": "姐姐，你说过的吧？要把现在所在的地方，还有最喜欢的人们……这一切都交给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1b651ca2cb5d5f8c2241a5aea685fb40ecaa4829f7dd186a22be3be2876ac3a", "ja": "でも、大丈夫。お姉ちゃんからもらったものは、\n今日のこのステージで、お姉ちゃんに返す。", "zh": "不过，没关系。姐姐给予我的一切，我会在今天的这个舞台上，还给姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "d7902ab737405671b4ae33db9887cb8b08ab2cf66c280bfbf9fbebdb4c202263", "ja": "真珠星……？", "zh": "珍珠星……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1053_044miz", "source_sha256": "acbb956cd23ab8441da897e2afc2f374a0d54a5adab6e909754d28ebe6578922", "ja": "それで……たとえお姉ちゃんがいなくても、私は私。\n一宮真珠星はアイドルだって、ステージで証明する。", "zh": "所以……即使姐姐不在，我也还是我自己。\n我会在舞台上证明，一宫真珠星就是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "c42ce9dfe21433c9992b5958151ce16fe9f32ea587183479ccbc6087eb6c9fa0", "ja": "自分の居場所は、自分で掴むの。\n……私は私自身の力、輝きで、アイドルになる！", "zh": "自己的容身之处，要由自己去抓住。\n……我要凭借我自己的力量和光芒，成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1055_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f57ef4a53d713155dc1f7879afc44be2701a83c2d06eb35ba0e1e49f64d0867", "ja": "……ふふっ。あは、あははっ！\nあー……真珠星にできるかなぁ？", "zh": "……呵呵。啊、哈哈哈！\n啊——……我能成为真珠星吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1056_026yur", "source_sha256": "8ceca61870ead81b22b94b7ff6ed64bdbaaa363194c645c888a5495754e1dff0", "ja": "でも、私も負けられないんだ。一番綺麗な姿を、\n覚えていてほしいから……全力でいくよ？", "zh": "不过，我也不能输。因为我希望你记住我最美的样子……我会全力以赴，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1057_044miz", "source_sha256": "65c01baac41fb6aa12463946684a322b8121c2464697eacae0994e0bc04803ca", "ja": "いいよ！\n全力のお姉ちゃんを、超えてみせるから！", "zh": "来吧！\n我会超越全力以赴的姐姐给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_06_1058_025roc", "source_sha256": "c769670665830c79a44ed8dcf4dcaca9f496322396ce64047fc17eec67cf3d0f", "ja": "……。そろそろ始まるわ。\n行きましょうか、伝説のステージの幕開けよ。", "zh": "……差不多要开始了。\n走吧，传奇舞台即将拉开帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
